{
  "info": {
    "name": "Photographer Website API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Photographer Portfolio & Booking Platform backend.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection\n2. Set the `base_url` variable (default: http://localhost:5000)\n3. Run \"Register\" or \"Login\" — the JWT token auto-saves to `{{token}}`\n4. All protected routes use `{{token}}` automatically via Bearer auth\n\n## Flow to test booking + payment\n1. Register/Login\n2. Get Packages → copy a package `_id`\n3. Create Booking (photography type) → copy `bookingId`\n4. Create Payment Order → use bookingId\n5. Verify Payment (use Razorpay test mode signature)\n\n## Environment Variables\n- `base_url` — API base URL\n- `token` — JWT auto-saved after login/register\n- `bookingId` — set manually after creating a booking\n- `packageId` — set manually after fetching packages\n- `cameraId` — set manually after fetching cameras\n- `queryId` — set manually after creating a query",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bookingId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "packageId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "cameraId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "queryId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "photoId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/health",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.token);",
                  "  console.log('Token saved:', data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rahul Sharma\",\n  \"email\": \"rahul@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@1234\",\n  \"phone\": \"9876543210\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.token);",
                  "  console.log('Token saved:', data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"rahul@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@1234\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (me)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rahul Updated\",\n  \"phone\": \"9999999999\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/change-password",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"Test@1234\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewTest@1234\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"NewTest@1234\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/logout" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Account",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me" }
        }
      ]
    },
